<title>HONG KONG: Merrill sets warrants on Hongkong Land.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets warrants on Hongkong Land.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Tuesday it has launched 220 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hongkong Land Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 US$2.421	PREMIUM	    12.30 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.4642     GEARING	    4.5x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   23.APR.98     MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     US$2.69	 SETTLEMENT DATE  17.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG     LISTING DATE     18.JUN.97</p>
<p> NOTE		   CASH OR PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
